xRocket Pay API
 1.0.0 
OAS 3.0
xRocket API


Authorize
Cheques
An acceptance controller for processing payouts using personalized xRocket checks as the payment method.



POST
/api/v1/cheques
Create cheque


Issue a personal cheque to perform an accept-type payout. The amount is reserved from the application balance and can be redeemed by the recipient or cancelled before redemption. When targetType and target are set, only the addressed user is allowed to redeem the cheque.

Parameters
Callbacks
Try it out
No parameters

Request body

application/json
Example Value
Schema
{
  "clientChequeId": "string",
  "asset": "USDT",
  "amount": "123.456",
  "password": "pwd",
  "description": "This cheque is the best",
  "callback": {
    "callbackUrl": "https://example.com/webhooks/cheque",
    "payload": {}
  },
  "url": {
    "successUrl": "https://example.com/success",
    "cancelUrl": "https://example.com/cancel"
  },
  "targetType": "telegram_user_id",
  "target": "123"
}
Responses
Code	Description	Links
200	
