GET
/api/v1/cheques
Get list of cheques


List personal cheques issued for accept-type transfers. Use this to monitor pending, redeemed, or cancelled cheques. Cancelled cheques are excluded from the list.

Parameters
Try it out
Name	Description
fromDate
string($date-time)
(query)
From date (ISO 8601)

2024-12-23T12:50:15.570Z
toDate
string($date-time)
(query)
To date (ISO 8601)

2024-12-23T12:50:15.570Z
targetType
string
(query)
Target type for cheque, has to be passed together with target

Available values : user_id, telegram_user_id, telegram_username


telegram_user_id
target
string
(query)
Target identifier for cheque (depends on targetType), has to be passed together with targetType

123
state
string
(query)
Cheque state

Available values : active, completed, draft, error


--
cursor
string
(query)
Cursor for pagination

cursor
limit
number
(query)
100
Responses
Code	Description	Links
200	
Media type

application/json
Controls Accept header.
Example Value
Schema
{
  "items": [
    {
      "chequeId": "string",
      "clientChequeId": "string",
      "asset": "USDT",
      "description": "This cheque is the best",
      "targetType": "telegram_user_id",
      "target": "123",
      "links": {
        "telegramBotLink": "https://t.me/xRocket?start=mc_qwerty123",
        "telegramMiniAppLink": "https://t.me/xRocket?start=mc_qwerty123",
        "webLink": "https://t.me/xRocket?start=mc_qwerty123"
      },
      "state": "active",
