PUT
/api/v1/cheques
Update cheque


Modify an active unredeemed cheque. Only description can be updated, pass an empty string to clear it. The cheque must be in active state, not cancelled and not yet redeemed.

Parameters
Try it out
Name	Description
chequeId
string
(query)
Cheque id

chequeId
clientChequeId
string
(query)
Unique cheque id in your system

clientChequeId
