Payouts
A non-acceptance payment method for automatic user disbursement directly on our platform.



POST
/api/v1/payouts
Payout funds to user


Parameters
Callbacks
Try it out
No parameters

Request body

application/json
Example Value
Schema
{
  "clientPayoutId": "abc-def",
  "target": "87209764",
  "targetType": "telegram_user_id",
  "asset": "USDT",
  "amount": "1.23",
  "description": "You are awesome!",
  "callback": {
    "callbackUrl": "https://example.com/webhooks/payout",
    "payload": {}
  }
}
